; brief-sar-9 — MRI_Loop_Coil by co-simulation: LoopPorts.c3d's four ports (the feed and the three capacitor gaps, each a
; 50 Ohm port) as one EM Field Data block, the tutorial's 5.4 pF capacitors put back across the gaps here, and its 2.5 Ohm
; feed driving port 1. The fields analysis recombines the run's per-port fields with the waves this circuit delivers.
Cgap = 5.4 pF
Port:P1 feed 0 Num=1 Z=2.5 Ohm
EmFieldData:EM1 feed cl cr ct File="../results/LoopPorts CoSim.openems.cemr"
C:Cleft cl 0 C=Cgap
C:Cright cr 0 C=Cgap
C:Ctop ct 0 C=Cgap
analysis SP1 type=sparam start=200 stop=400 npts=201 Unit=MHz
analysis F1 type=fields block=EM1 freq=298 freqUnit=MHz drive=1
